<title>USA: EMB Corp says rescinds agreement.</title>
<headline>EMB Corp says rescinds agreement.</headline>
<dateline>COSTA MESA, Calif. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>EMB Corp said Tuesday it had rescinded its agreement with Realty Information System Inc.</p>
<p>The company did not disclose the nature of the agreement or offer a reason for its decision to rescind it.</p>
<p>Realty Information owns the Help-U-Sell Real Estate franchise.</p>
<p>EMB officials could not be reached for further comment.</p>
